  "description": "UVETAR crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C154 H167 Dy7 N2 O36 2+,2(N1 O3 1-). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3A (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4A (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 19 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 1.349-3.844 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 30.88-118.22°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy7(OH)6(thmeH2)5(thmeH)(tpa)6(MeCN)2](NO3)2. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
